Matches a reconstruction from same-ID crystal coordinates

>  <SOURCE_REFERENCES>
["https://github.com/jensengroup/xyz2mol_tm/blob/db2734b084045ef895528c7a3d5040d38da23983/SMILES_csvs/csd_smiles.csv"]

