["https://github.com/jensengroup/xyz2mol_tm/tree/db2734b084045ef895528c7a3d5040d38da23983/SMILES_csvs","https://github.com/uiocompcat/tmQM/tree/ece824419c9006fe66436daf233822b75533b82f/tmQM"]

>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Site-by-site g-xTB correction of ligand connectivity. Both original and revised same-ID graphs contain HSeO₄⁻. O7 bears H, Its distance from Se is 1.811 Å, Bond order 0.890; The other three Se–O bonds are shorter. Draw double bonds to two terminal O atoms, Assign O⁻ to coordinating O6, Retain the water and phosphine, Ag(I) balances the net charge. Localized terminal Se–O single and double bonds represent one delocalized limiting form. Localized 36 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. Use the supplied Lewis representation for scoring; Independent evidence for the complete graph is limited.

>  <UPSTREAM_COMPARISON>
Not equivalent

>  <SPIN_REVIEW>
Not independently verified

